## 4. Testing Strategy

| Layer | Tooling | Scope |
|---|---|---|
| Unit | {{TEST_FRAMEWORK}} | Core business logic ({{CORE_DIFFERENTIATOR_NAME}}), pure functions |
| Integration | {{TEST_FRAMEWORK}} | API routes / module boundaries against a test datastore, mocked external calls |
| Time-dependent (if any) | {{TIME_MOCK_TOOL}} | Anything threshold/schedule-based — must be deterministic, not wall-clock-dependent |
| E2E (later) | manual / browser check | Full critical-path flow |

